{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique world where ancient Egyptian myths meet alien technology. Equip the masks of Horus, Anubis, and others to unleash godlike abilities. Master anti-gravity tech to craft and command your own Solar Barge, and uncover the lost truths of gods, death, and eternal life. A forgotten dynasty waits for you to rewrite its legend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/68645cd14182d01ac9c184e0d4d76420.poster.avif?t=1761879132\" width=560 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/68645cd14182d01ac9c184e0d4d76420.webm?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/68645cd14182d01ac9c184e0d4d76420.mp4?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harsh survival in the scorching lands:</strong> The DLC introduces a completely new map with a setting reminiscent of Egypt. There will be many familiar features such as pyramids, temples, etc. However, there are also \u201cotherworldly\u201d elements such as floating \u201cislands,\u201d upside-down pyramids in the sky, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/53a64a5514e9451eb5890bd8e04a9f09.poster.avif?t=1761879132\" width=560 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/53a64a5514e9451eb5890bd8e04a9f09.webm?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/53a64a5514e9451eb5890bd8e04a9f09.mp4?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Egyptian Gods\u2019 Themed Masks:</strong> With the first new mask you receive, modeled after the god Horus, you will be able to fly. Additional new masks based on Egyptian gods such as Anubis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/3fcbe1da20378372eadc1c22c1212e38.poster.avif?t=1761879132\" width=560 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/3fcbe1da20378372eadc1c22c1212e38.webm?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/3fcbe1da20378372eadc1c22c1212e38.mp4?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/e3f4b727ccb90ea01c840e4fbf926c89.poster.avif?t=1761879132\" width=560 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/e3f4b727ccb90ea01c840e4fbf926c89.webm?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/e3f4b727ccb90ea01c840e4fbf926c89.mp4?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boats and Anti-gravity ships:</strong> A core gameplay element will be the \u201cbarge,\u201d a kind of \u201cmobile base\u201d that allows you to travel through the air to other locations. The \u201cbarge\u201d will become increasingly customizable as your civilization progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/8d765010de910b81de42fa87f7a5ba6e.poster.avif?t=1761879132\" width=560 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/8d765010de910b81de42fa87f7a5ba6e.webm?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/8d765010de910b81de42fa87f7a5ba6e.mp4?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966020?t=1761879132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966020?t=1761879132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/d8fcbb01d8a80084d7c454fe0f0fd3f972b92ee8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761879132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/d8fcbb01d8a80084d7c454fe0f0fd3f972b92ee8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761879132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a unique world where ancient Egyptian myths meet alien technology. Equip the masks of Horus, Anubis, and others to unleash godlike abilities. 