> With the first new mask you receive, modeled after the god Horus, you will be able to fly. Additional new masks based on Egyptian gods such as Anubis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/3fcbe1da20378372eadc1c22c1212e38.poster.avif?t=1761879132\" width=560 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/3fcbe1da20378372eadc1c22c1212e38.webm?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/3fcbe1da20378372eadc1c22c1212e38.mp4?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/e3f4b727ccb90ea01c840e4fbf926c89.poster.avif?t=1761879132\" width=560 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/e3f4b727ccb90ea01c840e4fbf926c89.webm?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/e3f4b727ccb90ea01c840e4fbf926c89.mp4?t=1761879132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boats and Anti-gravity ships:</strong> A core gameplay element will be the \u201cbarge,\u201d a kind of \u201cmobile base\u201d that allows you to travel through the air to other locations. The \u201cbarge\u201d will become increasingly customizable as your civilization progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966020/extras/8d765010de910b